  "notes": "## 0.7.0-alpha.4 - 2026-05-06\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make per-device sync settings take effect for sending, receiving, and content type filters.\n- Fix device sync switches so changes save instead of reverting immediately.\n- Prevent clipboard copies made right after unlocking the app from being missed while peers reconnect.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.7.0-alpha.4 - 2026-05-06\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 让每台设备的同步设置真正作用于发送、接收和内容类型过滤。\n- 修复设备同步开关改动后会立刻回弹、无法保存的问题。\n- 避免应用解锁后立即复制内容时，因为设备仍在重连而漏掉同步。",
